  "chapter.nerodecor.architect.title": "Architect",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.first_light.title": "First Light",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.first_light.desc": "Eight neon blocks, any colour. A base can be functional and still glow - this is where it starts to look like somewhere people live.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.hull_plating.title": "Hull Plating",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.hull_plating.desc": "Sixteen pieces of hull - blocks, slabs, stairs or walls, in any alloy. The same plating that skins a starship makes a handsome workshop.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.clean_lines.title": "Clean Lines",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.clean_lines.desc": "Sixteen panels in any finish. Flat, even, ordered - the quiet backdrop that lets everything else on the wall stand out.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.through_the_glass.title": "Through the Glass",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.through_the_glass.desc": "Eight pieces of tinted glass. Give the hull a window and the view becomes part of the design.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.starsteel_frame.title": "Starsteel Frame",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.starsteel_frame.desc": "Four starsteel pillars. Every grand hall needs a skeleton, and these carry the look of a station bulkhead.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.circuitry.title": "Circuitry",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.circuitry.desc": "Circuit plating for the walls and a holo-grid underfoot. A control room that looks like a control room.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.power_aesthetic.title": "Power Aesthetic",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.power_aesthetic.desc": "A fusion lamp and a pair of capacitor banks. Nothing here generates a single watt, and nobody visiting will ever believe that.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.into_the_void.title": "Into the Void",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.into_the_void.desc": "Void rifts and a crystal lattice. A little deep space, hung on the wall where you can admire it safely.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.xeno_garden.title": "Xeno Garden",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.xeno_garden.desc": "Xeno blooms under aurora glass. An alien garden is proof that a base can be a home, not just a factory.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.full_spectrum.title": "Full Spectrum",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.full_spectrum.desc": "Hold one neon block of every colour - all twelve. A complete palette, ready for whatever you build next.",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.master_architect.title": "Master Architect",
  "quest.nerodecor.architect.master_architect.desc": "Power, void and garden: you have built with every family NeroDecor has to offer. Whatever stands on your land now, it was designed."
}
